<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<link rel="icon" href="/oyd-mark.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<title>DPP Service · OwnYourData</title>
<meta name="description" content="Public instance of the DPP Service, an open-source implementation of the EN 18222:2026 lifecycle API for Digital Product Passports, operated by OwnYourData.">
<%= render "shared/consent_head" %>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #f7f7f5;
    --surface: #ffffff;
    --text: #1d2327;
    --muted: #5b6770;
    --line: #e2e5e8;
    --accent: #0b6e4f;
    --accent-soft: #e3f2ec;
    --wip: #8a5a00;
    --wip-soft: #fbf0d9;
    --bad: #b42318;
    --radius: 12px;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #121517;
      --surface: #1b1f22;
      --text: #e8ebed;
      --muted: #9aa5ad;
      --line: #2c3236;
      --accent: #4cc293;
      --accent-soft: #173229;
      --wip: #e6b85c;
      --wip-soft: #33291a;
      --bad: #f28b82;
    }
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font: 16px/1.55 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  .wrap { max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
  header { padding: 20px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  header .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .01em; white-space: nowrap; }
  .brand .mark { width: 15px; height: auto; display: block; }
  .brand span { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 400; margin-left: -5px; }
  header nav a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; margin-left: 18px; font-size: 15px; }
  header nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .hero { padding: 56px 0 36px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(28px, 4.2vw, 40px); line-height: 1.15; margin: 0 0 14px; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .lead { font-size: 18px; color: var(--muted); max-width: 680px; margin: 0 0 12px; }
  .nonprofit { color: var(--muted); max-width: 680px; margin: 0 0 26px; font-size: 15px; }
  .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; border: 1px solid var(--accent);
  }
  .btn.primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--surface); }
  .btn.secondary { color: var(--accent); background: transparent; }
  h2 { font-size: 20px; margin: 44px 0 16px; }
  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(210px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .grid.two { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .card {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;
  }
  .card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 17px; }
  .card h3 a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px; }
  .card h3 a .go { color: var(--accent); margin-left: 6px; display: inline-block; transition: transform .15s; }
  .card h3 a:hover { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .card h3 a:hover .go { transform: translateX(2px); }
  .card h3 a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
  .card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; flex: 1; }
  .card .links { font-size: 15px; display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .soon { color: var(--muted); }
  .badge {
    align-self: flex-start; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .03em;
    text-transform: uppercase; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .badge.live { color: var(--accent); background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .badge.wip { color: var(--wip); background: var(--wip-soft); }
  .panel {
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 20px;
  }
  .panel p { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--muted); }
  .panel p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  ul.repos { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  ul.repos li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); flex-wrap: wrap; }
  ul.repos li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  ul.repos .what { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; }
  .section-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; gap: 12px 24px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 44px 0 16px; }
  .section-head h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; }
  .section-head .intro { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; max-width: 640px; }
  .section-head .btn { flex-shrink: 0; }
  .services { padding: 0; overflow: hidden; }
  table.services-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 15px; }
  .services-table th { text-align: left; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); padding: 12px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: bottom; }
  .services-table td { padding: 14px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  .services-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  .services-table tr.this td { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-soft) 55%, var(--surface)); }
  .services-table tr.this td:first-child { box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent); }
  .services-table .name { font-weight: 600; }
  .services-table th:nth-child(1) { width: 28%; }
  .services-table th:nth-child(2) { width: 20%; }
  .services-table th:nth-child(3) { width: 26%; }
  .services-table .badge { margin-left: 6px; vertical-align: 1px; font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 7px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .services-table .sub { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; margin-top: 2px; }
  .services-table .passport + .passport { margin-top: 8px; }
  .src { display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid currentColor; margin-right: 5px; vertical-align: 0; }
  .src.operator { background: currentColor; }
  .tone-pass { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; }
  .tone-warn { color: var(--wip); font-weight: 600; }
  .tone-fail { color: var(--bad); font-weight: 600; }
  .tone-neutral { color: var(--muted); }
  .legend { margin: 10px 2px 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .legend li { margin: 2px 0; }
  .services-notice { margin: 10px 2px 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; max-width: 760px; }
  .services-more { margin: 8px 2px 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .services-table thead { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip: rect(0 0 0 0); white-space: nowrap; }
    .services-table, .services-table tbody, .services-table tr, .services-table td { display: block; width: 100%; }
    .services-table tr { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 6px 0; }
    .services-table tbody tr:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
    .services-table td, .services-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; padding: 6px 16px; }
    .services-table tr.this { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-soft) 55%, var(--surface)); box-shadow: inset 3px 0 0 var(--accent); }
    .services-table tr.this td { background: transparent; }
    .services-table tr.this td:first-child { box-shadow: none; }
    .services-table td::before { content: attr(data-label); display: block; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); }
  }
  code { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: .92em; }
  footer { margin-top: 56px; padding: 24px 0 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
  footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  footer a { color: var(--muted); }
  footer .legal a { margin-right: 16px; }
  footer .funding { flex-basis: 100%; font-size: 13px; }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    header nav a { margin: 0 14px 0 0; }
    .hero { padding-top: 36px; }
    .grid.two { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand"><img class="mark" src="/oyd-mark.svg" alt="" width="15" height="28">DPP Service <span>· OwnYourData</span></div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/kb/">Knowledge Base</a>
      <a href="/api-docs/index.html">API</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-service-public">GitHub</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Digital Product Passports on open standards</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      OwnYourData operates this public instance of the DPP Service, an open-source
      implementation of the EN&nbsp;18222:2026 lifecycle API with passport content
      following EN&nbsp;18223:2026. Reading passports is public and needs no account.
    </p>
    <p class="nonprofit">OwnYourData is a non-profit association: all tools on this page are free of charge and open source.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="/api-docs/index.html">Explore the API</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="https://dpp.oydapp.eu/01/09520123456788/21/000001">Example passport (JSON)</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2>Tools</h2>
  <div class="grid two">
    <article class="card">
      <span class="badge live">New</span>
      <h3><a href="/kb/">DPP Knowledge Base<span class="go" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></h3>
      <p>Self-contained articles on what the EU requires, how the published standards fit together and how these tools put them into practice.</p>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="/kb/">All articles</a>
        <a href="/kb/laws-and-standards/">Laws and standards</a>
        <a href="/kb/dpp-roadmap/">Roadmap</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="badge live">Available</span>
      <h3><a href="/kb/getting-started/">DPP Manager<span class="go" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></h3>
      <p>Application for economic operators that runs on their own computer: describe products, create passports and publish them through a DPP service.</p>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="/kb/dpp-manager/">Explained</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-service-public/blob/main/docs/DPP-Manager-Demo.md">Walkthrough</a>
        <a href="https://hub.docker.com/r/oydeu/dpp-manager">Docker Hub</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-manager-public">Source</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="badge live">Available</span>
      <h3><a href="https://dpplint.ownyourdata.eu/">DPP Linter<span class="go" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></h3>
      <p>Enter a product identifier and see whether the passport behind it resolves, is readable without an account and follows the published data model.</p>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="/kb/dpp-linter/">Explained</a>
        <a href="https://dpplint.ownyourdata.eu">dpplint.ownyourdata.eu</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpplint">Source</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="badge live">Available</span>
      <h3><a href="https://ownyourdata.github.io/dpp-validator/">DPP Service Validator<span class="go" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></h3>
      <p>Daily automated checks of listed DPP services against open criteria, with results published for everyone to see.</p>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="/kb/dpp-service-validator/">Explained</a>
        <a href="https://ownyourdata.github.io/dpp-validator/">Results</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-criteria">Criteria</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-validator">Source</a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <%= render "available_services", services: @services, notice: @services_notice %>

  <h2>Source code</h2>
  <div class="panel">
    <ul class="repos">
      <li><a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-service-public">dpp-service-public</a><span class="what">This service – Rails API, runs stand-alone</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-manager-public">dpp-manager-public</a><span class="what">DPP Manager – runs on the operator’s own computer</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-criteria">dpp-criteria</a><span class="what">Open criteria and service list – contributions welcome</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpplint">dpplint</a><span class="what">DPP Linter – checks the passport behind a product identifier</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-validator">dpp-validator</a><span class="what">DPP Service Validator – daily checks of listed DPP services against the criteria</span></li>
      <li><a href="https://github.com/OwnYourData/dpp-knowledge-base">dpp-knowledge-base</a><span class="what">DPP Knowledge Base – self-contained articles on Digital Product Passports</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <h2>Building blocks</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h3>OYDID</h3>
      <p>The <code>did:oyd</code> method used for passport and actor identifiers.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://oydid.ownyourdata.eu">oydid.ownyourdata.eu</a></div>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h3>SOyA</h3>
      <p>Data models and validation for passport content.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://soya.ownyourdata.eu">soya.ownyourdata.eu</a></div>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
      <h3>DID Lint</h3>
      <p>Checks DID documents against the W3C DID specification.</p>
      <div class="links"><a href="https://didlint.ownyourdata.eu">didlint.ownyourdata.eu</a></div>
    </article>
  </div>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>Operated by <a href="https://www.ownyourdata.eu/en/">OwnYourData</a></div>
<%= render "shared/legal_links" %>
    <div class="funding"><!-- funding:begin -->The DPP Service is part of <a href="https://dpp-austria.at/">PACE-DPP</a>. This Lighthouse Project has been made possible by financial contributions from the Austrian Federal Ministry of Innovation, Mobility and Infrastructure (<a href="https://www.bmimi.gv.at/en.html">BMIMI</a>, formerly BMK), supported by the Austrian Research Promotion Agency (FFG) under grant number <a href="https://projekte.ffg.at/projekt/5128301">917177</a>, as well as from the German Federal Ministry of Research, Technology and Space (BMFTR, formerly BMWK), supported by the German Research Promotion Agency (DLR-PT).<!-- funding:end --></div>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
